		External services fail or delay intermittently
		Test data is unstable or content is dynamic
		The state is shared between tests without reset
		Elements are not fully loaded before interaction

	How to Reduce Test flakiness in cypress
		Use should() to verify readiness 
		Extend retry logic with Cypress.config
		Isolate test with clean data and reset status
		Avoud cy.wait()
		Use stable selectors, not dynamic ones

